        </h2>
        <p>
          Educational psychology research demonstrates that <em>how</em> you distribute your study time matters far more than the raw number of hours you sit with a textbook:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-1">
